set as a producer obviously as a

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:18.740
director I'm running the set but when I
get to post if I'm the producer I like

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:23.240
to do everything I like to be the person
who locks the cut I like to be there in

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:26.150
the scoring session work with the
composer do all the visual effects sit

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:29.449
in the editing room do the color correct
be there for the mix to be there for the

00:00:29.449 --> 00:00:33.319
final mix all of that I like I love that
part of it I was a musician in high

00:00:33.319 --> 00:00:37.100
school I like the music I liked the
whole because I think there's three

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.699
