this and I think that's one of the

00:00:44.749 --> 00:00:48.829
reasons there's an Emmy on my shelf and
not on other shelves is that there's

00:00:48.829 --> 00:00:54.589
three very distinct parts of making a
movie the first part is the script and

00:00:54.589 --> 00:00:58.579
that script is written to get somebody
to give you the money that's its job the

00:00:58.579 --> 00:01:03.379
job of that script is how do we get to
make the movie the script isn't here's

00:01:03.379 --> 00:01:07.579
the plan for the film here's what it
should look like here's what it should

00:01:07.579 --> 00:01:13.039
be that job of that piece of pay those
120 pages is to get someone to say

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:19.280
you're greenlit go make the movie now
you have with the money now you have a

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:23.659
second period which is the production
period which is less make the movie now

00:01:23.659 --> 00:01:26.869
whatever's in that script may not
necessarily you may get a piece of

00:01:26.869 --> 00:01:30.740
casting that comes in that you know what
they're better than what was there we're

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:34.609
gonna change that or we go to the
location and that location doesn't exist

00:01:34.609 --> 00:01:38.060
you may want a house that overlooks the
water but you know on this budget I

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:41.420
can't afford a house that overlooks the
budget so what we look the water so

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:45.409
we're gonna find another house that's
where you take what was in the script

00:01:45.409 --> 00:01:49.999
and now you have a production script now
you have a production plan and now

00:01:49.999 --> 00:01:54.649
you're making the best movie you can
from that part of the creative process

00:01:54.649 --> 00:02:01.280
it's no longer the script it's now the
production script and now you finish now

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:04.549
you get to the editing room most of the
people that television movie biz is that

00:02:04.549 --> 00:02:09.110
I've worked with will use the script and
put the film together the way the script

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:14.069
